  "hints": [
    "On 10.0.0.0/24 the first 24 bits name the network: every PC's address starts with 10.0.0 and has prefix length 24.",
    "10.0.0.0 names the network and 10.0.0.255 is its broadcast address: neither can be a PC's.",
    "Two PCs with the same address confuse everyone: give each its own."
